{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"704","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Thor"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thor is getting used to the Earth. As a gift Loki gave him a smartphone. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" applications on this phone. Thor is fascinated by this phone. He has only one minor issue: he can't count the number of unread notifications generated by those applications (maybe Loki put a curse on it so he can't)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" events are about to happen (in chronological order). They are of three types:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Application "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" generates a notification (this new notification is unread). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Thor reads all notifications generated so far by application "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" (he may re-read some notifications). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Thor reads the first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" notifications generated by phone applications (notifications generated in first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" events of the first type). It's guaranteed that there were at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" events of the first type before this event. Please note that he doesn't read first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" unread notifications, he just reads the very first "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" notifications generated on his phone and he may re-read some of them in this operation. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please help Thor and tell him the number of unread notifications after each event. You may assume that initially there are no notifications in the phone."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, q ≤ 300 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of applications and the number of events to happen."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the events. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of these lines starts with an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"typei"},{"kind":"text","text":" — type of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th event. If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"typei = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"typei = 2"},{"kind":"text","text":" then it is followed by an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":". Otherwise it is followed by an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ti"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ typei ≤ 3, 1 ≤ xi ≤